sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant CC as ClassificationController
    participant AI as AIInferenceGatewayService
    participant FP as FastAPI

    Note over Client,FP: Prerequisite — Transaction 1.1 has persisted the business profile with confirmed category allocations.

    %% ── Compute Uniqueness Score ────────────────────────────────────────────
    Note over Client,FP: Calibration Phase 2 — Compute Uniqueness Score

    Client->>CC: POST /api/v1/classification/uniqueness
    Note right of Client: UniquenessRequest {businessName, categories(pct>0), coreServices, description, uvp}
    CC->>AI: computeUniqueness(payload)
    AI->>FP: POST /internal/classification/uniqueness
    FP-->>AI: {overallScore, semanticsScore, categoryScore, descriptionFeedback, categoryFeedback}
    AI-->>CC: Map~String,Object~
    CC-->>Client: UniquenessResponse {overallScore, semanticsScore, categoryScore, descriptionFeedback, categoryFeedback}
